OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Faffect northern and northwestern
OL,7,Fareas. Elsewhere remains mostly dry
OL,8,Fwith long clear spells. Cooler than
OL,9,Fthe previous night, with winds
OL,10,Fgradually easing, especially across
OL,11,Fsouthern areas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FMostly dry with sunny
OL,14,Fspells. A few showers affect the
OL,15,Fnorthwest, with thicker cloud and rain
OL,16,Flater. Breezy at first in the far
OL,17,Fnorth before easing. Temperatures near
OL,18,Faverage.
